CREATE A COMPLETE INTERACTIVE ROMANTIC WEBSITE FOR JULIANA

============================================================
PROJECT CONCEPT
============================================================

Create a beautiful, deeply romantic, emotional, cinematic personal website dedicated to someone named Juliana.

The website is called:

“A Collection of Affections Dear to My Heart”

The main featured work inside the collection is:

“A Hundred Reasons Why My Heart Still Belongs to You”

This website should feel like a private digital love letter, an old Victorian journal, a romantic memory album, and a moonlit garden combined into one experience.

This is NOT a generic Valentine's Day website.

It should feel personal, mature, elegant, intimate, nostalgic, romantic, bittersweet, and sincere.

The central message of the entire website is:

“I am not asking you to return.
I am not asking you for anything.
I simply want you to know how deeply you were loved.”

The relationship has ended, and the narrator still loves and cherishes Juliana. The website must communicate love without guilt, pressure, manipulation, or demanding that she return.

